ine, where every detail tells a story, and every shadow holds a secret.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667560/extras/89eaeb0c91dfc0b14c3b41fa5caa6062.poster.avif?t=1738172041\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667560/extras/89eaeb0c91dfc0b14c3b41fa5caa6062.webm?t=1738172041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667560/extras/89eaeb0c91dfc0b14c3b41fa5caa6062.mp4?t=1738172041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NARRATIVE -DRIVEN PUZZLES:</h2>Solve intricate puzzles that reveal pieces of your past and the truth behind the desolate landscape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667560/extras/d5df74638bf70d6694d3d059937488aa.poster.avif?t=1738172041\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667560/extras/d5df74638bf70d6694d3d059937488aa.webm?t=1738172041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667560/extras/d5df74638bf70d6694d3d059937488aa.mp4?t=1738172041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Crimson Tide, survival is not just about reaching your destination, but about confronting the ghosts of your past and the shadows of your deepest fears. Can you uncover the truth before time runs out? Or will you become another lost soul, forever echoing in the abyss of the crimson tide?",
